         <pdf:Keywords>WAVE; WAVE Broadband Push-to-Talk; WAVE Broadband PTT; Broadband PTT; Unified PTT; byod; byob; push to talk; PTT; push-to-talk; mission critical communications; public safety communications; WAVE Desktop Communicator; Desktop Communicator; TwistedPair; Twisted Pair</pdf:Keywords>
         <pdf:Producer>Adobe PDF Library 10.0.1</pdf:Producer>
