isted Pair)/ModDate(D:20160309082629-05'00')/Producer(Adobe PDF Library 10.0.1)/Subject(Desktop Communicator is a feature-rich software application that allows office-based or mobile workers to use their desktop or laptop PC to monitor, transmit, and receive audio from multiple communication systems such as two-way radio networks and telepho\
